        <mxCell id="KMrnfizv_kjCtf4Co5FG-9" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=21;" value="Spring Boot App&#xa;   ↓ sends logs directly over TCP on port 5000&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;Logstash&#xa;   ↓ receives logs on 5000&#xa;   ↓ parses / filters / enriches logs&#xa;   ↓ sends logs to Elasticsearch on 9200&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;Elasticsearch&#xa;   ↓ stores logs in index&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;Kibana&#xa;   ↓ reads logs from Elasticsearch&#xa;   ↓ shows dashboard on 5601&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;User / Browser&#xa;   ↓&#xa;http://localhost:5601" vertex="1">
