        <mxCell id="iZKDblrOnI7t_5yLlSij-28" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="10:00 AM&#xa;Bad event received&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;10:00 AM&#xa;Elasticsearch rejects document due to mapping conflict&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;10:00 AM&#xa;Logstash writes event to DLQ&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;10:05 AM&#xa;Alert shows DLQ size increasing&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;10:10 AM&#xa;SRE checks DLQ reason&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;10:20 AM&#xa;Team fixes Logstash filter or Elasticsearch mapping&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;10:30 AM&#xa;DLQ reprocess pipeline is started&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;10:31 AM&#xa;Failed events are read from DLQ&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;10:32 AM&#xa;Events are transformed correctly&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;10:33 AM&#xa;Corrected events are indexed into Elasticsearch" vertex="1">
